*> Corrigé TP1.3 : laboratoire MOVE, MOVE CORRESPONDING, INITIALIZE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TP13.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
*> Partie A
01 WS-A1-SRC  PIC 9(4)    VALUE 1234.
01 WS-A1-DST  PIC 9(2).
01 WS-A2-DST  PIC 9(6).
01 WS-A3-SRC  PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 12.78.
01 WS-A3-DST  PIC 9(3).
01 WS-A4-DST  PIC 9(2)V9.
01 WS-A5-SRC  PIC X(8)    VALUE "ABCDEFGH".
01 WS-A5-DST  PIC X(4).
01 WS-A6-SRC  PIC X(3)    VALUE "ABC".
01 WS-A6-DST  PIC X(6).

*> Partie B
01 WS-SAISIE.
   05 NOM      PIC X(10) VALUE "DUPONT".
   05 PRENOM   PIC X(10) VALUE "Marie".
   05 VILLE    PIC X(10) VALUE "Nantes".
01 WS-AFFICHAGE.
   05 PRENOM   PIC X(10) VALUE "?".
   05 NOM      PIC X(10) VALUE "?".
   05 PAYS     PIC X(10) VALUE "FRANCE".

*> Partie C
01 WS-GROUPE.
   05 WS-TXT   PIC X(8)    VALUE "ABCDEFGH".
   05 WS-NUM   PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 123.45.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE WS-A1-SRC TO WS-A1-DST
    MOVE WS-A1-SRC TO WS-A2-DST
    MOVE WS-A3-SRC TO WS-A3-DST
    MOVE WS-A3-SRC TO WS-A4-DST
    MOVE WS-A5-SRC TO WS-A5-DST
    MOVE WS-A6-SRC TO WS-A6-DST
    DISPLAY "1234  -> 9(2)    : " WS-A1-DST
    DISPLAY "1234  -> 9(6)    : " WS-A2-DST
    DISPLAY "12.78 -> 9(3)    : " WS-A3-DST
    DISPLAY "12.78 -> 9(2)V9  : " WS-A4-DST
    DISPLAY "ABCDEFGH -> X(4) : [" WS-A5-DST "]"
    DISPLAY "ABC -> X(6)      : [" WS-A6-DST "]"

    MOVE CORRESPONDING WS-SAISIE TO WS-AFFICHAGE
    DISPLAY "--- MOVE CORRESPONDING ---"
    DISPLAY "PRENOM : " PRENOM OF WS-AFFICHAGE
    DISPLAY "NOM    : " NOM OF WS-AFFICHAGE
    DISPLAY "PAYS   : " PAYS OF WS-AFFICHAGE "  (non copie : absent de la source)"

    DISPLAY "--- INITIALIZE ---"
    DISPLAY "Avant : " WS-GROUPE
    INITIALIZE WS-GROUPE
    DISPLAY "Apres : [" WS-GROUPE "]"
    STOP RUN.
